": "关于Vael。明晚，我把剩下的说完。", "en": "About Vael. Tomorrow, I’ll tell you the rest."}], "options": [{"zh": "别得意。我很会观察。", "en": "Don’t get smug. I’m observant.", "reply": {"zh": "我已经注意到了。正努力表现得无所谓。", "en": "I noticed. I’m trying to look unaffected."}}, {"zh": "明天我要真话。", "en": "The truth tomorrow.", "reply": {"zh": "你会得到。玩笑不能顶账。", "en": "You’ll get it. Jokes don’t pay that debt."}}]}, {"episode": 3, "opening": {"zh": "信上的那条，我早就知道。明晚当面说清。", "en": "I knew about that clause. Tomorrow, in person."}, "options": [{"zh": "把我蒙在鼓里很聪明？", "en": "Was keeping me in the dark clever?", "reply": {"zh": "聪明，不等于正确。这次我不躲问题。", "en": "Clever doesn’t mean right. I’m not dodging that question."}}, {"zh": "明晚别用调情转移话题。", "en": "No flirting your way out tomorrow.", "reply": {"zh": "收到。你比王庭会立规矩。", "en": "Understood. You set better rules than the court."}}]}, {"episode": 4, "opening": {"zh": "明晚先交出王位。实际签名，不只承诺。", "en": "Tomorrow I give up the throne first. A signature, not another promise."}, "options": [{"zh": "我会看着。", "en": "I’ll be watching.", "reply": {"zh": "那我更不该偷懒。", "en": "Then I really shouldn’t take the easy way out."}}, {"zh": "今晚，你可以先做Rhys。", "en": "Tonight, you can just be Rhys.", "reply": {"zh": "好。我会敲门。", "en": "All right. I’ll knock."}}]}, {"episode": 5, "opening_if": [{"flag": "bed_kiss", "zh": "刚才不是条款漏洞。是你主动的那一下。", "en": "That wasn’t a loophole. It was you making the move."}, {"flag": "forehead_kiss", "zh": "你给的规矩，记起来很容易。", "en": "Your rules are remarkably easy to remember."}, {"else": true, "zh": "谢谢你没有把我当成一个待解决的问题。", "en": "Thank you for not treating me like a problem to solve."}], "options": [{"zh": "明晚先签你的决定。", "en": "Sign your own choice tomorrow.", "reply": {"zh": "会的。你不用替我付账。", "en": "I will. You won’t pay my bill."}}, {"zh": "等你的普通早餐。", "en": "I’m expecting an ordinary breakfast.", "reply": {"zh": "普通这个标准，我会努力达到。", "en": "Ordinary. A standard I’ll work hard to meet."}}]}, {"episode": 6, "routes": {"A": {"opening": {"zh": "今日身份：普通室友。今日挑战：咖啡。", "en": "Today’s title: ordinary roommate. Today’s challenge: coffee."}, "options": [{"zh": "先交作业。", "en": "Show me your work.", "reply": {"zh": "杯子在K1。人就在你旁边。", "en": "Cup’s on the counter. I’m beside you."}}, {"zh": "过来。今天不用王冠。", "en": "Come here. No crown today.", "reply": {"zh": "好。这次只是你叫我。", "en": "All right. This time it’s simply you calling me."}}]}, "B": {"opening": {"zh": "两个形态，一份家务。我提出异议。", "en": "Two forms. One chore list. I object."}, "options": [{"zh": "异议驳回。", "en": "Objection denied.", "reply": {"zh": "你让我恢复自由，又剥夺了我偷懒的权利。", "en": "You restored my freedom and revoked my right to be lazy."}}, {"zh": "那先选人形过来。", "en": "Choose the human form and come here first.", "reply": {"zh": "选择已做出。接下来轮到你。", "en": "Choice made. Your move."}}]}, "C": {"opening": {"zh": "公文办完。下一次是私人来访。", "en": "Official business finished. Next visit is personal."}, "options": [{"zh": "带咖啡。", "en": "Bring coffee.", "reply": {"zh": "收到。这个任务比废止条款更有压力。", "en": "Understood. More pressure than repealing the clause."}}, {"zh": "要敲门。", "en": "You have to knock.", "reply": {"zh": "当然。这一次，只有你能邀请我。", "en": "Of course. This time only you can invite me."}}]}}}], "complete": true, "review_only": true, "first_cut": true, "build": {"source": "video-production-seedance25-480p-20261020", "crf": 23, "note": "web-compressed from native 480p masters"}}